{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given number is a Woodall number (n * 2^n - 1).\"\"\"\n    if number < 0:\n        return False\n\n    target = number + 1\n    n = 1\n    max_iter = 1024  # Limit iterations for safety, as n*2^n grows very fast\n\n    while n <= max_iter:\n        product = n * (1 << n)  # Calculate n * 2^n\n\n        if product == target:\n            return True\n        if product > target:\n            return False\n        \n        n += 1\n    \n    return False"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/14", "solution": "def find_Volume(base, triangle_height, prism_height):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the volume of a triangular prism.\n    The volume is computed by multiplying the area of its triangular base by the prism's height.\n    \"\"\"\n    triangle_area = 0.5 * base * triangle_height\n    volume = triangle_area * prism_height\n    return volume"}
