{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "from typing import TypeVar, Callable, Optional, Any, List\nT = TypeVar(\"T\")\ndef comb_sort(items: List[T], key: Optional[Callable[[T], Any]] = None, reverse: bool = False) -> List[T]:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of elements using the Comb Sort algorithm, non-destructively.\"\"\"\n    arr = list(items)\n    n = len(arr)\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n\n    def _next_gap(current_gap: int) -> int:\n        next_g = int(current_gap / shrink_factor)\n        return max(1, next_g)\n\n    while gap != 1 or swapped:\n        gap = _next_gap(gap)\n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            val_a = key(arr[i]) if key else arr[i]\n            val_b = key(arr[i + gap]) if key else arr[i + gap]\n\n            if (val_a > val_b) ^ reverse:\n                arr[i], arr[i + gap] = arr[i + gap], arr[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return arr"}
