{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using dynamic programming.\n    Assumes n is an integer greater than or equal to 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        return 1\n\n    a = [0] * (n + 1)\n    a[1] = 1\n    a[2] = 1\n\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        a[i] = a[a[i - 1]] + a[i - a[i - 1]]\n\n    return a[n]"}
