{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "def next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to n.\n    Handles n=0 by returning 1, and uses bit manipulation for n > 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Decrement n to handle cases where n is already a power of 2.\n    v = n - 1\n    # Set all bits to 1 right of the most significant bit.\n    v |= v >> 1\n    v |= v >> 2\n    v |= v >> 4\n    v |= v >> 8\n    v |= v >> 16\n    v |= v >> 32 # Covers up to 64-bit integers.\n    \n    # Increment to get the next power of 2.\n    return v + 1"}
