{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers raised to the fifth power using a closed-form formula.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Calculate sum of k^5 using Bernoulli's formula for S5(n) = n^2 (n+1)^2 (2n^2+2n-1) / 12\n    n_sq = n * n\n    n_plus_1_sq = (n + 1) * (n + 1)\n    two_n_sq_plus_two_n_minus_1 = (2 * n_sq) + (2 * n) - 1\n    \n    sum_k_pow_5 = (n_sq * n_plus_1_sq * two_n_sq_plus_two_n_minus_1) // 12\n    \n    # The sum of (2k)^5 is 2^5 * sum(k^5) = 32 * sum(k^5)\n    return 32 * sum_k_pow_5"}
