{"task_id": "Mbpp/277", "solution": "def dict_filter(input_dict: dict, n: int) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters a dictionary to include only entries with values greater than or equal to n.\n    Values are converted to integers; non-numeric values are skipped.\n    \"\"\"\n    filtered_dict = {}\n    for key, value in input_dict.items():\n        try:\n            numeric_value = int(value)\n            if numeric_value >= n:\n                filtered_dict[key] = numeric_value\n        except (ValueError, TypeError):\n            # Skip entries where value cannot be converted to an integer.\n            continue\n    return filtered_dict"}
