{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(items):\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates all possible combinations (subsets) of elements from a given list,\n    maintaining a deterministic order as specified in the design.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = [[]]\n    for element in reversed(items):\n        # Create a snapshot of the current results to avoid modifying it while iterating\n        snapshot = list(result)\n        for subset in snapshot:\n            result.append([element] + subset)\n    return result"}
