{"task_id": "Mbpp/567", "solution": "def issort_list(seq: Sequence[Any]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a sequence is sorted in non-decreasing order.\n\n    An empty sequence or a sequence with one element is considered sorted.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(seq)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        if seq[i] > seq[i + 1]:\n            return False\n    return True"}
