{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(first: tuple, second: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is strictly smaller than its\n    corresponding element in the first tuple. Assumes tuples have equal length.\n    \"\"\"\n    for a, b in zip(first, second):\n        if not (b < a):\n            return False\n    return True"}
